'''LeMurr''' (デカメガネル, ''Dekameganeru'') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

