==Trivia==
*Despite being named after [[wikipedia:Lemur|lemurs]], LeMurr more closely resembles [[wikipedia:Philippine tarsier|Philippine tarsiers]], small primates with large eyes found only in the city of [[wikipedia:Bohol|Bohol]].
*Her Japanese name, Dekameganeru (デカメガネル), is a combination of でかい ''dekai'' (big), 眼鏡 ''megane'' (glasses) and 眼鏡猿 ''meganezaru'' (tarsier).
*LeMurr's and her variants' descriptions involve eyewear. LeMurr wears special contacts, [[Loris]] is famous for his flashy taste in eyewear even though it's just what his eyes look like, and [[Tarsiriel]] got the wrong lens prescription.

